Yeah, like I'm from Canada and I look at being on time really different than you do, right?

186
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:15,180
Yes, because for example, if you call for a meeting at nine o'clock, usually people will be there at nine o'clock because the meeting will start.

187
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:15,780
In America.

188
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:16,880
Right, in America.

189
